## Known pitfalls in this codebase
- Tailwind v4: use `wrap-anywhere` (NOT `overflow-wrap-anywhere`). Use `bg-(--var)` /
  token utilities. Do NOT create self-referential `@theme inline { --x: var(--x) }`.
- React 19 + Next 16.3.1: `LayoutProps<"/">` typing in layout.tsx is intentional.
- React 19 rule: never mutate refs during render (`ref.current = x` in body is a lint error).
  Sync refs in a useEffect instead.
- FileDropzone: object-URL revocation is unmount-only via filesRef; per-file revocation
  happens in removeFile. Do NOT add a `files`-dependent effect that revokes live URLs
  (breaks visible thumbnails).
- `<label>` dropzone: do NOT nest the file `<input>` inside the label's drop surface as a
  descendant of another interactive element; input sits at top of the label card with
  `peer sr-only`, label uses `peer-focus-visible:outline` classes for keyboard focus.
